						"id": "51850ed1-16c8-550c-a32c-4a78af3fd348"
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"text": "Bear Claw Lodge is wildly overgrown on the first Summer trip, but inside is all is well and comfortable."
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "paragraph",
					"attrs": {
						"id": "4bad2e3b-2e5f-5de0-a2da-9efd739f3e02"
					},
					"content": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"text": "Teens often find the fire and wooded trails provide enough adventure. Building programs are frequent but easily accomplished. The brunt of all major construction is completed."
						}
					]
